## Problem classes

### `Skill used cwd as the hub`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| `phases/` or `rules/` appear inside a product git repo | Global skill assumed cwd is the planning hub | Read `"$HOME/.superplan/config.yml"` (`hub:`) and `<hub>/superplan.yml`. Follow `references/hub-resolution.md`. Refuse to write hub files into a bound product repo. |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-09 -->

### `Hub overrode the repo`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Plan or edit contradicts the repo's CLAUDE.md / tests | Hub spoke or Superplan default used instead of repo sources | Re-read the repo; follow it; report the conflict; ask the human if a rule change is needed |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-09 -->

### `Init helper missing after global install`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| `/superplan-init` cannot find the writer script | Helper lived only in the Superplan repo `scripts/` tree | Keep `init.sh` next to the pack `SKILL.md` |

